{"id":144049781,"slug":"clinical-trials-for-treatment-resistant","title":"Clinical Trials for Treatment Resistant Depression @ Fermata.Health in NYC","subtitle":"A public service announcement","post_date":"2024-04-26T18:53:53.192Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/clinical-trials-for-treatment-resistant","wordcount":226,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:53:20.060Z","body_sha256":"e7cc2f9f0f55856f107df6eae8e4251c8af78d9feb2c10ed0562c64d4b729188","text_words":225,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>For years, <a href=\"https://www.psychiatrymargins.com/p/synesthesia-of-distress-and-other\">Owen Scott Muir, M.D.</a>, the proprietor of this newsletter has been telling the world about treatments for depression that work.  I've also been routinely frustrated by the fact that the treatments weren't faster.  I think rapid relief of depression is a huge deal.  And…I've got some good news.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic\" width=\"1456\" height=\"606\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:606,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:774248,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t94H!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F890490d4-bbff-4ede-8351-18befec9f4d2.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>My clinic in New York City, <a href=\"https://www.fermata.health\">Fermata</a>, which I run with <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Carlene MacMillan, MD&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:20179948,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/62e4f131-0d58-4d2b-965c-4f226291bcd6_720x720.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c2d55716-65da-4c1c-a854-bdd8c6af48c5&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> , now has multiple clinical trials for major depressive disorder.  We even have one <a href=\"https://www.irxreminder.com\">clinical trial for tardive dyskinesia</a> still enrolling!</p><h2><a href=\"https://forms.monday.com/forms/e1f3efbcdf94e4d87ddb3dc834f05f46?r=use1\">Here is the link if you are interested in our clinical trials (or clinical care).</a></h2><p>So if you're an adult with depression, who hasn't responded to other treatments, please feel free to inquire via the link above— indicate you're interested in <a href=\"https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT06357832?term=fermata&amp;rank=4\">our clinical trials</a> for the treatment of depression to see if you qualify.</p><p>It's worth noting that my other gig, <a href=\"https://www.acaciaclinics.com\">Acacia Clinics</a>, in Sunnyvale, California, also has clinical trials running.  These include a study on <a href=\"https://www.acaciaclinics.com/tus-anxiety-trial\">Anxiety</a>—without medication.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/clinical-trials-for-treatment-resistant?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/clinical-trials-for-treatment-resistant?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p></p><div><hr></div><h2>Upcoming events!</h2><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rZCx!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimage