ster. I think rapid relief of depression is a huge deal. And…I've got some good news.\n\nMy clinic in New York City, Fermata , which I run with , now has multiple clinical trials for major depressive disorder. We even have one clinical trial for tardive dyskinesia still enrolling!\n\nHere is the link if you are interested in our clinical trials (or clinical care).\n\nSo if you're an adult with depression, who hasn't responded to other treatments, please feel free to inquire via the link above— indicate you're interested in our clinical trials for the treatment of depression to see if you qualify.\n\nIt's worth noting that my other gig, Acacia Clinics , in Sunnyvale, California, also has clinical trials running. These include a study on Anxiety —without medication.\n\nShare\n\nUpcoming events!\n\nEventbrite Ticket Link\n\nNext, I’m Appearing at…\n\nMay 7th — ATA Nexus in Phoenix!\n\nTickets.\n\nMay 15-16, Miami Beach + Virtual— I’m the Co-Chair!\n\nUse discount code OM15 for 15% off today by visiting https://bit.ly/3vgLlZy\n\nAnd then…A Virtual Conference, June 5-7th:\n\nNeurodiversity: A Conference for and About Doctors Who Think Differently (this is an affiliate link)\n\nSubscribe now"}